    "number": 1851,
    "title": "[Lyrical]: bounded dynamic boolean arrays fail to compile with Fast CDR C++ typesupport",
    "url": "https://github.com/ros2/ros2/issues/1851",
    "body": "### Generated by Generative AI\n\nWith the help of GPT-5.6-Luna\n\n### Operating System:\n\nUbuntu 26.04 LTS (Docker)\n\n### ROS version or commit hash:\n\nlyrical (using latest ros:lyrical-ros-base docker image with Manifest Digest: sha256:62bffdcbb9e5e2c74927376fa8233af14a0b1eb4c99c9e7f76e8221ce7c12a53)\n\n### RMW implementation (if applicable):\n\nrmw_fastrtps_cpp\n\n### RMW Configuration (if applicable):\n\n_No response_\n\n### Client library (if applicable):\n\nrclcpp\n\n### 'ros2 doctor --report' output\n\n_No response_\n\n### Steps to reproduce issue\n\n1. Create a ros 2 message package (e.g. test_msgs) with a .msg IDL file containing a bounded dynamic boolean array and an unbounded uint8 vector, e.g.\n```\nuint8[] buffer\nbool[<=10] up_to_ten_boolean_array\n```\n2. Build the ros 2 message package:\n`colcon build`\n3. The compilation fails, because of invalid mapping from ‘std::vector<bool>::reference’ to ‘std::u16string&’\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe message package compiles successfully like in previous distros, e.g. humble, jazzy\n\n### Actual behavior\n\nThe compilation fails with: \n```\n/test/ros2_test_workspace/build/test_msgs/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp/test_msgs/msg/detail/dds_fastrtps/valid_type__type_support.cpp: In function ‘bool test_msgs::msg::typesupport_fastrtps_cpp::cdr_deserialize_with_endpoint(eprosima::fastcdr::Cdr&, test_msgs::msg::ValidType&, const rmw_topic_endpoint_info_t&, const rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp::BufferSerializationContext&)’:\n/test/ros2_test_workspace/build/test_msgs/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp/test_msgs/msg/detail/dds_fastrtps/valid_type__type_support.cpp:1567:115: error: invalid initialization of non-const reference of type ‘std::u16string&’ {aka ‘std::__cxx11::basic_string<char16_t>&’} from an rvalue of type ‘std::vector<bool>::reference’\n 1567 |       bool succeeded = rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp::cdr_deserialize(cdr, ros_message.up_to_ten_boolean_array[i]);\n      |                                                                              ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^\nIn file included from /test/ros2_test_workspace/build/test_msgs/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp/test_msgs/msg/detail/dds_fastrtps/valid_type__type_support.cpp:16:\n/opt/ros/lyrical/include/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp/serialization_helpers.hpp:51:20: note: in passing argument 2 of ‘bool rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp::cdr_deserialize(eprosima::fastcdr::Cdr&, std::u16string&)’\n   51 |   std::u16string & u16str)\n      |   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~\ngmake[2]: *** [CMakeFiles/test_msgs__rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp.dir/build.make:331: CMakeFiles/test_msgs__rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp.dir/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp/test_msgs/msg/detail/dds_fastrtps/valid_type__type_support.cpp.o] Error 1\ngmake[2]: *** Waiting for unfinished jobs....\ngmake[1]: *** [CMakeFiles/Makefile2:479: CMakeFiles/test_msgs__rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps_cpp.dir/all] Error 2\ngmake[1]: *** Waiting for unfinished jobs....\ngmake: *** [Makefile:146: all] Error 2\n---\nFailed   <<< test_msgs [11.5s, exited with code 2]\n```\n\n### Additional information\n\n_No response_",
