      "body": "The issue was already fixed in https://github.com/ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps/pull/152\nSidenote: At the time of this comment the latest [lyrical docker base images](https://hub.docker.com/layers/library/ros/lyrical-ros-base/images/sha256-45cdbd74861b4c16297dd40f566c03182c13eebc455259f9f3a260550953c21b) use version [3.9.5]( https://github.com/ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps/tree/3.9.5) which does not have the fix yet. \nThe fix was introduced with [3.9.6]( https://github.com/ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps/tree/3.9.6).\n",
      "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">The issue was already fixed in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4404771238\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps/issues/152\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps/pull/152/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps/pull/152\">ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps#152</a><br>\nSidenote: At the time of this comment the latest <a href=\"https://hub.docker.com/layers/library/ros/lyrical-ros-base/images/sha256-45cdbd74861b4c16297dd40f566c03182c13eebc455259f9f3a260550953c21b\" rel=\"nofollow\">lyrical docker base images</a> use version <a href=\"https://github.com/ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps/tree/3.9.5\">3.9.5</a> which does not have the fix yet.<br>\nThe fix was introduced with <a href=\"https://github.com/ros2/rosidl_typesupport_fastrtps/tree/3.9.6\">3.9.6</a>.</p>",
